===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Either of the two ducts in female [[mammal]]s through which [[ova]] pass from the [[ovary|ovaries]] to the [[uterus]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|gonaduct}}
* {{l|en|oviduct}}
* {{l|en|salpinx}}
* {{l|en|uterine tube}}

